## The newsletter gap (the one Al spotted)
The newsletter currently ships with no standard CTA. It is the warmest, most recurring touchpoint with ~545 engaged subscribers, so it should carry **Block C** in every send (book first, advisory for the right reader). Blogs should carry **Block A or B** by intent. Both are template-level, so they are filed for Control to wire into `weekly-social-production` (newsletter) and `weekly-blog-draft` (blog), with the SEO console choosing A or B per post.
